      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>[untranslated]</li>\n<li>[untranslated]</li>\n<li>On Friday,</li>\n<li>(26 November 1148),</li>\n<li>I was sitting in al- Ma\u1e25alla to copy books</li>\n<li>as is my custom and the children were reading</li>\n<li>from the Torah before me. I heard them &ldquo;singing&rdquo; of an ugly matter.</li>\n<li>I said to them: &ldquo;What is this you speak about?</li>\n<li>and from whom you heard it?&rdquo;</li>\n<li>They answered: &ldquo;From the house of the cantor.&rdquo; I said:</li>\n<li>&ldquo;and the house of the cantor, from whom they heard it?\" They said, \"from Ma\u02bfan\u012b,</li>\n<li>their relative who was in Fustat.\" ...</li>\n<li>[untranslated]</li>\n<li>[untranslated]</li>\n<li>[untranslated]</li>\n<li>[untranslated]</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
